#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"TrackShip for WooCommerce integrates TrackShip into your WooCommerce Store "
"and auto-tracks your orders, automates your post-shipping workflow and "
"allows you to provide a superior Post-Purchase experience to your customers."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip za WooCommerce integrira TrackShip u vašu WooCommerce trgovinu i "
"automatski prati vaše narudžbe, automatizira vaš tijek rada nakon otpreme i "
"omogućuje vam da svojim kupcima pružite vrhunsko iskustvo nakon kupnje."

#: trackship-for-woocommerce.php:136
msgid "TrackShip for WooCommerce requires a Shipment Tracking extension."
msgstr "TrackShip for WooCommerce zahtijeva ekstenziju za praćenje pošiljaka."

#: includes/views/setup.php:29
msgid ""
"TrackShip is syncing fulfillment-based shipments automatically. All new "
"fulfillments will be tracked in real time."
msgstr ""
"TrackShip automatski sinkronizira pošiljke temeljene na fulfillmentima. Svi "
"novi fulfillmenti pratit će se u stvarnom vremenu."

