#: includes/mcp/class-trackship-abilities.php:220
msgid ""
"Trigger \"Get Shipment Status\" for one or more orders: sends their tracking "
"info to TrackShip and schedules a status refresh. Accepts \"order_id\" "
"(single) or \"order_ids\" (array, max 50). This is a state-changing action "
"that consumes a TrackShip tracking credit per shipped order — confirm with "
"the user first. Orders that are not shipped are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Pokreni \"Dohvati status pošiljke\" za jednu ili više narudžbi: šalje "
"podatke o njihovom praćenju TrackShip-u i zakazuje osvježavanje statusa. "
"Prihvaća \"order_id\" (jedan) ili \"order_ids\" (niz, maksimalno 50). Ovo je "
"radnja promjene stanja koja troši TrackShip kredit za praćenje po poslanoj "
"narudžbi - prvo potvrdite s korisnikom. Narudžbe koje nisu poslane se "
"preskaču."

